  "ingredients": [
    "1 large egg",
    "1 tablespoon lemon juice",
    "1 teaspoon Dijon mustard",
    "0.5 teaspoon salt",
    "0.25 teaspoon ground black pepper",
    "0.75 cup light olive oil"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/dfGcz09M51aasAYidmWLfSNoyJg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/272646-easy-homemade-mayonnaise-VAT-step-01-8eec6732239a49c8bbf9b5fddb79e7af.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/272646/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place egg, lemon juice, Dijon mustard, salt, and pepper in a large bowl or tall container. Pour oil on top.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/TRRXQx8xRGD4ue58ePcohehTaq0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/272646-easy-homemade-mayonnaise-VAT-step-02-44d22d80737049f0a5c0f939e73d32c1.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/272646/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Insert an immersion blender so the blade rests at the bottom. Blend for about 15 seconds without moving the blender head to draw the oil slowly down into the egg mixture and help it emulsify. Then, raise the blender slowly and continue blending just until the mayonnaise is thick and creamy, taking care not to over-blend.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/tHRJK1Ipu_YziL8a65TKx6Uf4M8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/272646-easy-homemade-mayonnaise-VAT-step-03-278a77e8512b42a49e60fca6602cf41c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/272646/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Transfer to a clean jar or airtight container. Refrigerate until ready to use or for up to 1 week.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Wrgjbbsqjhdin7FniTfaLvj2qJQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/272646-easy-homemade-mayonnaise-VAT-step-04-603d4ee4c4544a19b04d304f54281c0d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/272646/step_04.webp"
    }
  ],
